as much trouble as you did to get here.

253
00:11:00,360 --> 00:11:02,277
It doesn't matter which route you take.

254
00:11:02,360 --> 00:11:04,077
You eventually hit the red line.

255
00:11:04,160 --> 00:11:06,377
And everyone winds up on this archipelago

256
00:11:06,460 --> 00:11:09,225
with the hopes of getting
past that giant wall.

257
00:11:09,680 --> 00:11:11,877
It's a bit crazy that
all of the world's best

258
