266
00:11:32,360 --> 00:11:35,297
It'd be a smart move to at least
learn the names of your rivals.

267
00:11:35,380 --> 00:11:40,600
Okay, so there was Kidd, Hawkins,
and, uh, it was Drake, right?

268
00:11:51,220 --> 00:11:53,080
Her appetite is terrifying.

269
00:11:53,500 --> 00:11:56,500
How could she even fit all
that food into her body?

270
00:11:56,780 --> 00:11:57,610
More!

271
00:11:57,693 --> 00:11:58,640
Bring more food!

272
00:12:01,140 --> 00:12:02,980
What a vulgar woman.

273
00:12:05,400 --> 00:12:08,106
Just the cider has making
me lose my appetite.

274
00:12:08,340 --> 00:12:09,980
Go wire jaw shut.

275
00:12:10,240 --> 00:12:14,200
That's not a good idea father
We're right by Navy headquarters.

276
00:12:14,480 --> 00:12:16,774
The last thing we need to cause a scene

277
00:12:21,680 --> 00:12:23,140
Capone gang bag.

278
00:12:23,340 --> 00:12:27,634
He has a bounty of a hundred and thirty
eight million berries on his head

279
00:12:28,000 --> 00:12:29,577
Where's the rest of the food?

280
00:12:29,660 --> 00:12:31,660
Hurry and bring it before I starve

281
