286
00:12:47,460 --> 00:12:50,360
Her bounty, 140 million berries.

287
00:12:51,340 --> 00:12:52,170
Right.

288
00:12:52,253 --> 00:12:54,332
We'll have your food for you immediately.

289
00:12:55,920 --> 00:12:57,580
I'm so, so sorry.

290
00:13:01,760 --> 00:13:02,917
You little...

291
00:13:03,000 --> 00:13:03,880
Leave him be.

292
00:13:05,360 --> 00:13:07,360
You can't be serious, Captain.

293
00:13:07,580 --> 00:13:08,992
I'm soaked in spaghetti.

294
00:13:09,160 --> 00:13:10,278
Look at my clothes.

295
00:13:10,780 --> 00:13:13,080
Such was the fate of your pants.

296
00:13:13,660 --> 00:13:16,160
I apologize for my man threatening you.

297
00:13:16,820 --> 00:13:20,526
Taking a life on this day will
only bring our crew bad fortune.

298
00:13:21,480 --> 00:13:23,600
Basil Hawkins, the magician.

299
00:13:23,960 --> 00:13:27,500
He has a bounty of 249 million berries.

300
00:13:32,620 --> 00:13:33,450
What the?

301
