They're fighting!

302
00:13:35,040 --> 00:13:39,740
Could you really not wait for the
other side of the red line to fight me?

303
00:13:40,200 --> 00:13:44,800
Just curious, but do you
have any clue who I am?

304
00:13:45,700 --> 00:13:48,320
The Sea Roar, Scratchman Apu.

305
00:13:48,600 --> 00:13:52,380
The bounty on his head
is 198 million berries.

306
00:13:53,880 --> 00:13:56,980
All I know is you wouldn't
stop staring at me.

307
