Captain, please don't do it!

308
00:13:59,380 --> 00:14:01,700
You are one creepy-looking bastard.

309
00:14:02,240 --> 00:14:05,358
Why don't you just let me
put you out of your misery?

310
00:14:06,800 --> 00:14:08,540
Eustass Captain Kit.

311
00:14:08,880 --> 00:14:12,580
His bounty, 315 million berries.

312
00:14:17,840 --> 00:14:20,040
The mad bone's on a rampage!

313
00:14:22,280 --> 00:14:25,339
We gotta get out of here
before he levels the place!

314
00:14:35,480 --> 00:14:39,460
If you want to go wild,
save it for the new world!

315
00:14:41,000 --> 00:14:43,080
