320
00:14:59,380 --> 00:15:02,200
He has a bounty worth 108 million berries.

321
00:15:03,100 --> 00:15:07,571
You should get down on your knees and
thank Drake for your life, masked man.

322
00:15:08,180 --> 00:15:10,600
