379
00:18:34,580 --> 00:18:36,957
They're impossible to catch in open water.

380
00:18:37,040 --> 00:18:38,780
I appreciate all the info.

381
00:18:39,040 --> 00:18:40,569
You came to the right man.

382
00:18:40,780 --> 00:18:45,000
And for that info, you can
have 10 % of her selling price.

383
00:18:45,300 --> 00:18:47,820
Well, we were really hoping for 20.

384
00:18:49,040 --> 00:18:52,120
I mean, 10 % is plenty!

385
00:19:05,100 --> 00:19:06,060
We're here!

386
00:19:06,560 --> 00:19:08,280
Savoni Park! Yay!

387
00:19:09,520 --> 00:19:10,480
Oh, man!

388
00:19:10,740 --> 00:19:11,797
This place looks fun!

389
00:19:11,880 --> 00:19:12,710
Focus!

390
00:19:12,793 --> 00:19:13,623
