It's so fair as well!

396
00:19:21,866 --> 00:19:23,777
Have you ever seen it
from this class before?

397
00:19:23,860 --> 00:19:25,180
All right! Listen up!

398
00:19:25,480 --> 00:19:26,400
It's fun time!

399
00:19:27,160 --> 00:19:29,117
You're not even trying to find him!

400
00:19:29,200 --> 00:19:30,030
Yay!

401
00:19:30,280 --> 00:19:32,957
