to step inside that place!

402
00:19:33,040 --> 00:19:34,275
Absolutely forbidden!

403
00:19:37,900 --> 00:19:40,940
My, what a lovely and
leisurely ride this is!

404
00:19:41,440 --> 00:19:43,793
Oh, and look at this view, how relaxing!

405
00:20:07,060 --> 00:20:10,700
Yes, gentle rides like
this one are more my style.

406
00:20:11,000 --> 00:20:14,588
This way I can still enjoy the
lovely view without having to.

407
00:20:28,180 --> 00:20:29,533
Faster, faster, faster!

408
00:20:30,680 --> 00:20:31,640
Faster! Faster!

409
00:20:34,520 --> 00:20:36,577
What the heck is wrong with you people?

410
00:20:36,660 --> 00:20:38,597
Who in the right minds
would spend that hard?

411
00:20:38,680 --> 00:20:39,510
Are you crazy?

412
00:20:39,640 --> 00:20:41,934
