413
00:20:45,620 --> 00:20:46,520
Oh, wow!

414
00:20:46,920 --> 00:20:48,260
We're so high up!

415
00:20:48,560 --> 00:20:50,520
Look, over here, the ocean!

416
00:20:51,060 --> 00:20:51,890
Cool!

417
00:20:56,880 --> 00:20:58,180
It's all so beautiful!

418
00:21:00,400 --> 00:21:02,929
It's the most amazing
thing I've ever seen!

419
00:21:04,880 --> 00:21:07,620
Hey, what's the crying
all about? It's just...

420
00:21:08,140 --> 00:21:11,611
I've dreamed of this moment
ever since I was a little girl.

421
00:21:16,340 --> 00:21:18,697
I've never been so high
up in the air before!

422
00:21:18,780 --> 00:21:20,177
I'll always remember this day.

423
00:21:20,260 --> 00:21:21,319
Thank you so much!

424
00:21:21,640 --> 00:21:23,437
I couldn't have come here without you.

425
00:21:23,520 --> 00:21:28,402
Hatchan and Papaku only let me come to this
place because I knew you'd keep me safe.

426
00:21:40,700 --> 00:21:41,530
You.

427
00:21:41,620 --> 00:21:45,620
I gotta admit, I'm probably every
bit as happy as Kuma is right now.

428
00:21:45,880 --> 00:21:48,617
Every mer-child and fish kid
dreams of coming to this place,

429
00:21:48,700 --> 00:21:50,697
though not many of us get to really do it.

430
00:21:50,780 --> 00:21:52,640
So high! So high!

431
00:21:52,940 --> 00:21:53,940
So very high!

432
00:21:54,180 --> 00:21:55,360
Let's ride this one!

433
00:21:55,800 --> 00:21:56,820
Gondola!

434
00:21:57,380 --> 00:21:58,210
Yeah!

435
00:21:59,140 --> 00:22:01,780
Go, go, go, go! Ah!

436
00:22:02,500 --> 00:22:03,330
Ah!

437
00:22:04,480 --> 00:22:05,310
Come on!

438
00:22:05,480 --> 00:22:07,060
I'm so excited! Come on!

439
00:22:08,580 --> 00:22:18,643
Ah!

440
00:22:18,726 --> 00:22:19,556
Ah! Ah!

441
00:22:19,960 --> 00:22:20,790
Ah!

442
00:22:23,100 --> 00:22:23,930
Ah!

443
00:22:38,020 --> 00:22:40,520
High Priest-A-Rouge, look over there.

444
00:22:42,540 --> 00:22:44,180
My, my, what a sight.

445
00:22:49,000 --> 00:22:50,617
A celestial dragon, huh?

446
00:22:50,700 --> 00:22:55,112
to think they'd wander around the
lawless area without a care in the world.

447
00:22:55,360 --> 00:22:59,860
I don't like this, but our only choice
is to kneel and let him pass on by.

448
00:23:10,160 --> 00:23:13,580
Sharia and father left
me, and in this cesspool,

449
00:23:15,280 --> 00:23:17,457
where did they wander off to this time?

450
00:23:17,540 --> 00:23:20,197
Well, we do know their final
destination, so rest easy.

451
00:23:20,280 --> 00:23:22,398
We'll meet up with them soon enough.

452
00:23:26,700 --> 00:23:30,940
Slow as a turtle you can't crawl
gracefully, but a horrible ride!

453
00:23:43,940 --> 00:23:46,397
Hey you what are you doing there?

454
00:23:46,480 --> 00:23:48,000
Why are you moving?

455
00:23:48,200 --> 00:23:49,906
You should be still and proud

456
00:23:51,900 --> 00:23:53,380
I'm so very sorry.

457
00:23:53,660 --> 00:23:55,189
Please overlook this, sir.

458
00:23:55,380 --> 00:23:56,968
This man needs urgent care.

459
00:23:57,400 --> 00:23:59,037
We're reaching against time.

460
00:23:59,120 --> 00:24:00,885
The hospital is just up ahead.

461
00:24:03,900 --> 00:24:05,040
Yes, I see.

462
00:24:05,180 --> 00:24:06,837
This is very bad indeed.

463
00:24:06,920 --> 00:24:09,200
Well, in that case, you must be swift.

464
00:24:16,360 --> 00:24:18,580
And put him out of his misery!

465
00:24:22,400 --> 00:24:24,600
I beg you, stop! Oh, no!

466
00:24:26,240 --> 00:24:27,660
Look at that.

467
00:24:27,900 --> 00:24:29,860
Now that is one selfish noble.

468
00:24:32,840 --> 00:24:35,360
Tell me, what's more important?

469
00:24:35,500 --> 00:24:38,720
Showing me courtesy or
a mere commoner's life?

470
00:24:39,180 --> 00:24:43,062
Every commoner owes their very
existence to the Celestial Dragons.

471
00:24:46,300 --> 00:24:47,140
It's settled.

472
00:24:47,340 --> 00:24:48,928
I'm making you my new wife.

473
00:24:49,240 --> 00:24:50,122
Very good, sir.

474
00:24:50,280 --> 00:24:53,757
I shall make arrangements to send her to
the Holy Land as your thirteenth wife.

475
00:24:53,840 --> 00:24:57,557
By the by, I've grown quite weary
of wives one through five lately.

476
00:24:57,640 --> 00:24:59,677
Have them sit back to
live with the commoners.

477
00:24:59,760 --> 00:25:01,317
Of course, sir, as you wish.

478
00:25:01,400 --> 00:25:02,397
Please don't do this!

479
00:25:02,480 --> 00:25:03,310
I beg you!

480
00:25:03,393 --> 00:25:04,223
What are you doing?

481
00:25:04,306 --> 00:25:05,136
She's my fiancée!

482
00:25:05,219 --> 00:25:06,784
You can't just come here and...

483
00:25:09,420 --> 00:25:12,538
How dare you speak to me
when you should be kneeling!

484
00:25:17,180 --> 00:25:18,010
Marie.

485
00:25:22,460 --> 00:25:23,560
You murderer!

486
00:25:23,980 --> 00:25:24,980
How could you?

487
00:25:25,720 --> 00:25:27,020
Somebody help him!

488
