Please let go of me! Stop it!

495
00:25:48,680 --> 00:25:51,460
Take her ahead to the
harbor for me. Yes, sir.

496
00:25:52,760 --> 00:25:53,590
Who's that?

497
00:25:56,440 --> 00:25:57,897
I recognize him, Captain.

498
00:25:57,980 --> 00:26:00,697
That guy's Pirate Hunter
Zoro from the East Blue.

499
00:26:00,780 --> 00:26:03,157
